# 12 Filters (v6 slide 8)
"""[14:30 - 16:00]  KEY MESSAGE: the filters turn the field data into target lists in seconds.
The filters are where the data becomes useful.
You can filter by sales channel and rep in one tree, and by region and district.
You can filter by the products found on the shelf, for example all shops with fake product, or all shops without Castrol.
You can filter the potential customers by their level and by the reason they do not buy yet.
And you can filter by visit status: visited, overdue or never visited.
For a potential customer we record the potential level, the reasons, for example a price mismatch or a contract with a competitor, the litres per month we expect, and the next follow-up date. So the team knows exactly whom to win next, and why. For example: all workshops in one district that do not buy Castrol because of a contract with a competitor, each with its next follow-up date.""",

